  <item>
    <title>11:缓和医疗向人而行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69552b8c14db1df9efcd8f0d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69552b8c14db1df9efcd8f0d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 14:06:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: &nbsp;2025年最重要事情不是退休了，而是我加入了北京协和医院的缓和医疗志愿者团队；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a>: &nbsp;疼痛的身心社灵四方面：身体疼痛、心理疼痛、社会关系社会网络的疼痛、灵性疼痛；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a>: &nbsp;以“病”为中心向以“人”为中心转变的医疗理念；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a>: &nbsp;患者家属也可以挂号“缓和医疗门诊”的….；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>: &nbsp;志愿者的热情热心，不要添乱、不要增加被服务者的心理负担；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>: &nbsp;2025年的两场告别。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Happy New Year 2026 🎈</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ae006f7349f7a5577b2862/lk0UjlLNDSj3MqBpRNUdDcCrghYX.m4a" length="20004624" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJjQZX5jtwQV3W_CIJpKWw4wSxm.jpg"/>
